nx2:gsv: command 1121 returns a raw session

Ported from Djihads80/Eglantine #630 (5400de4dd0 and eba05370d8, by
EvelynSwitch2), still open there; its service half, which follows Eden-NS2.
Welcome Tour stopped at 1121 with the zeroed stub. The new session answers the
TIPC handshake by echoing its token and returns zero from command 11, a stub.
Not called in any Ocarina or Mario Kart World log from today. No switch: the
source has none.

diff --git a/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h b/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h
